# Lupus Nephritis Glomerular Signature

This notebook summarizes a reproducible transcriptomics workflow based on GEO dataset GSE32591.

## Clinical focus
Glomerular lupus nephritis versus control glomerular tissue.

## Methods
- R: GEOquery + limma
- Python: prioritization and plotting

import pandas as pd

deg = pd.read_csv("../results/tables/ln_glomerular_limma_results.tsv", sep="\t")
deg.head()


## Differential expression output

The table below contains the limma differential expression results for the glomerular LN vs control comparison.


summary = pd.read_csv("../results/tables/ln_glomerular_summary_metrics.tsv", sep="\t")
summary

## Prioritized genes

Genes were ranked using a simple score combining effect size and adjusted p-value.

top = pd.read_csv("../results/tables/ln_glomerular_top20.tsv", sep="\t")
top.head(20)

## Top upregulated genes

top_up = pd.read_csv("../results/tables/ln_glomerular_top10_up.tsv", sep="\t")
top_up

## Top downregulated genes


top_down = pd.read_csv("../results/tables/ln_glomerular_top10_down.tsv", sep="\t")
top_down

